  "description": "The System.Text.Json equivalent for XML that .NET developers have been begging for! A modern XML serializer, UTF-8 reader and writer, and DOM for .NET, with a Roslyn source generator and full Native AOT and trimming support. A fast, low-allocation alternative to XmlSerializer, XmlReader, XmlWriter, and XDocument: 3x faster than System.Xml on average with 85% less memory allocated. Supports XML 1.0 and 1.1, has no dependency on System.Xml, and rejects DTDs by default.",
